  Combined Hash Rosin Product Page
  ─ TOP:    Sorbetto Master Case hero card (case selector, jars, live viewers, feature card, bottom pills)
  ─ BELOW:  Individual Hash Rosin product sections (Donutte template)
  ─ FONTS:  Playfair Display (headings) + DM Sans (body) — matches the rest of the site
{% endcomment %}

